# Cursor IDE Rules — Jornada Dashboard

# Project Instructions
- Read `.ai/PROJECT_INDEX.md` first to locate functions and files.
- Read `.ai/ARCHITECTURE.md` before editing data logic.
- Keep module files inside `js/` under 300 lines.
- Always validate JS syntax with `node -c` after making changes.
- Never remove global function exports attached to `window`.
- SDD PROTOCOL IS MANDATORY: You must always generate an implementation plan/SPEC and wait for approval before coding, even for trivial fixes or CSS changes. NO EXCEPTIONS.
- PROD DEPLOY PROTOCOL: It is strictly forbidden to commit/push/deploy to production without asking the user if they want to test locally first or proceed with the full deploy (requires dual Proceed: 1 for local, 2 for prod).
